n, an earthen cave, you see them. HUMANS, you think first, and your hearth jump for a second, because they are your Kin. Than you see it. They just were humans, generations ago. They are inbreed, pale, wyrmlike THINGS. Tamed and kept for the enjoyment of your foes. Nothing pure, nothing beautiful, nothing true remained in their ugly shells. They tore at eachother, and not at their captors. Slaves of Sin.<br /> <br /> Than you give in, tore of your mask of, grabs your gun and shout at them. It's time to Rage.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}